 "subtitle": "Word Pack 1 — kana words",
 "intro": "These are all written in **kana**, so you can already read every one of them — no new kanji. They are the words the stories were missing: things to **do**, ways to **feel**, and words for **what something is like**. From the next chapter on they can turn up any time, without being listed as new words.",
